OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for library reopening after
OL,4,Aceiling collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA library that closed after its ceiling
OL,7,Fpartially collapsed could reopen before
OL,8,Fthe end of the year.
OL,10,FCharminster Library in Bournemouth has
OL,11,Fbeen shut since December due to the
OL,12,Fdamage and what Bournemouth
OL,13,FChristchurch and Poole (BCP) Council
OL,14,Fpreviously described as "serious
OL,15,Fbuilding safety concerns".
OL,17,FThe council said "significant progress"
OL,18,Fhad been made in repairing the building
OL,19,Fand it aimed to reopen the library in
OL,20,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
