OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for library reopening after
OL,4,Aceiling collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a social media post, local MP Tom
OL,7,FHayes and the Friends of Charminster
OL,8,FLibrary campaign group described it as
OL,9,F"really good news".
